 prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Dernières lignes droites de la reprise pour valider  que tout va bien quand on met de la vitesse. Comme ça, on reprend la semaine prochaine les fractionnés","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_25","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":25,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5.140057023167604,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1500,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_50","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Normalement tu devrais avoir retrouvé un début de sensation sur tes footings en cette troisième semaine. Si c'est encore bof bof, les intensités à partir de la semaine prochaine vont finir de relancer la machine, ne t'inquiète pas.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_50","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":50,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":8.746355685131196,"expectedDuration":3000},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":3000,"pace":{"value":328}}]}],"weekStats":{"expectedDistance":26.131310667482474,"realDistance":0,"expectedDuration":9000,"realDuration":0},"exportStatus":"NotAvailable","goalDuration":{"durationInWeeks":8,"index":3},"coach":{"name":"Tristan","image":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1765362553-tristan-tete.png"},"access":"allowed"},{"userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","_id":"6a830d27ba8e8236710c1a1a","articles":["Y2kRza6pRdOsRsIQxSYo7w","ZRLmRmhpR9OMI7QfSdLgaA","JZ0pBc-cQD2GTbh_DhOYFQ","GssCR6PsTvu-36aGA22sVQ"],"weekDate":1788739200000,"context":{"priority":"performance","backgroundGoal":"speed","goalId":"6a830ca0ed61b9f01c19e536","cycleTheme":"S30","cycleDescription":"Ce cycle de S30 est la colonne vertébrale de ta préparation 5km, en parallèle du cycle VMA. Ces deux intensités \"entourent\" ton allure de course 5km. Un c