ale : elle est simplement là pour te maintenir actif(ve) et éviter le désentraînement. Le travail est fait, fais-toi confiance.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_15","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":191,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":3.444188887858047,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":900,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":191}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":191}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":191}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z2","duration":120,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"5KM","description":"Le travail est fait, il est temps de t'amuser ! Sur 5 km, la difficulté est souvent de trouver le bon équilibre entre partir assez vite sans se mettre dans le rouge trop tôt. Fais confiance à l'entraînement : les premières minutes doivent te sembler rapides, mais maîtrisées. Reste concentré(e) sur tes sensations et accepte l'inconfort qui arrivera progressivement. Aujourd'hui, il n'y a plus rien à construire, seulement à exprimer ce que tu as développé ces dernières semaines. Bonne course !","displayName":"5KM","coachAdvice":"L'équipe CAMPUS te souhaite bon courage pour ta compétition ! On est tous derrière toi :)","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Competition","trainingCategory":"road_competition","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"course","value":233,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"race"},"durations":[{"value":1165,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5,"expectedDuration":1165},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z5","duration":1165,"pace":{"value":233}}]}],"weekStats":{"expectedDistance":22.872970095303298,"realDistance":0,"expectedDuration":7285,"realDuration":0},"exportStatus":"NotAvailable","goalDuration":{"durationInWeeks":8,"index":8},"coach":{"name":"Tristan","image":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1765362553-tristan-tete.png"},"access":"allowed"},{"userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","_id":"6a830d27ba8e8236710c1a1f","articles":["ObXpXK6XSy-fr8_aJhItFQ","SKkKvzByTEaKSdNKIAogVA","FJQyh9BlSreDiTQtuZP6Hg","QZyRe9g5S3yMygHxCZPUVQ","fp50XhGlQMiaUp_nTdIdZA"],"weekDate":1791763200000,"context":{"priority":"performance","backgroundGoal":"speed","goalId":"6a830ca0ed61b9f01c19e536","cycleTheme":"post-competition","cycleDescription":"Ce \"bloc\" permet de t'octroyer le repos nécessaire (et mérité) après ta course, puis de reprendre progressivement avant la suite de ton plan d'entrainemen